From: firejackson1 <98654507+firejackson1@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] trona: retained wireless API, xt_qtaguid and audit changes for Android 17

Kernel changes used by the Trial by Fire Android 17 system image on the
Fire HD 10 (2021): xt_qtaguid for the legacy network accounting path,
cfg80211/nl80211 wireless API updates, lsm_audit and af_inet adjustments,
and trona_defconfig updates. Built with LOCALVERSION=-trona17wifiapi1.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/Makefile
@@ -199,6 +199,7 @@
